Changes made in this repository
-------------------------------
api/
- Runs on Node instead of Bun: Nitro preset "node-server"; npm scripts call node and prisma;
  `npm start` reads api/.env.
- Loads the libsql native addon in the main process so `nitro dev` keeps answering after
  server-file reloads on Windows.
- Added a deterministic seed script (prisma/seed.ts) and the db:seed script.
- Removed the upstream unit tests, the Bun lockfile, Makefile, CI workflows and the git submodule.

web/
- Calls the local API (http://localhost:3000/api) instead of the hosted demo API.
- Loads icons and fonts from web/src/theme/ instead of public CDNs, and its global styles and
  images from web/src/theme/conduit/ instead of the submodule.
- Removed the window.__conduit_debug__ test hook, the upstream unit tests and their tooling
  (Vitest, jsdom, test setup), the end-to-end test configuration and scripts, Playwright,
  git-hook tooling (husky, lint-staged), Angular CLI analytics, the Bun lockfile, CLAUDE.md,
  CI workflows and the git submodule.
- Added a character counter and a 500-character limit to the comment box on the article page.

Both READMEs were rewritten for this repository.
